<tr><td style="padding:28px 28px 8px;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.01em">PokeFindr</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 28px 28px"><p style="margin:0 0 12px">Hi Ash,</p><p style="margin:0">Someone asked to reset the password for your PokeFindr account.</p><p style="margin:24px 0"><a href="https://pokefindr.example/api/identity/verify-email?token=abc&amp;callbackURL=%2Flogin%3Fverified%3D1" style="display:inline-block;background:#2563eb;color:#f8fafc;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:8px">Choose a new password</a></p>
<p style="margin:0;color:#6b6b6b;font-size:13px">Or paste this link into your browser:<br><span style="word-break:break-all">https://pokefindr.example/api/identity/verify-email?token=abc&amp;callbackURL=%2Flogin%3Fverified%3D1</span></p><p style="margin:20px 0 0;color:#6b6b6b;font-size:13px">The link works for 1 hour. If it wasn't you, ignore this email: your password stays the same.</p></td></tr>
